  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PublicPrivate Infrastructure Advisory Facility SubNational Technical Assistance Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The trust fund development objective is to provide financing for PPIAF sub-national technical assistance activities. This PPIAF sub-national program aims to strengthen sub-national government entities (municipalities, local utilities, etc.) so that they can access affordable private sector finance (from banks or bond markets) on commercial terms, without sovereign government guarantees.</narrative>
  </description>
